u  and in that moment bakugou makes up his  mind  that he will help deku in this fight no  matter what it takes  bakugo will not let deku carry this  burden alone so he and todoroki managed  to get endeavour  up to shigaraki and endeavour grabs the  villain and then  in the very next moment endeavor  unleashes his prominence burn  super move as a result of this massive  attack  shigaraki's body is basically burnt to a  crisp  and for a brief moment it seems as if  the battle  might be over but then somewhere deep  within shigaraki  he hears that voice again shigaraki  hears  all for one calling to him telling him  to hand his body  over to him back when he first awoke and  unlocked the powers of all for one  there was a moment when all for one's  consciousness seemed to briefly take  over  shigaraki's body and when that happened  shigaraki called the original one for  all user his  brother even though shigaraki of course  doesn't have a brother  by all accounts this seems to have been  all for one himself  speaking through shigaraki's body at  that point  i theorized that perhaps all for one's  consciousness  or at least a part of his consciousness  had remained  inside all for one's quirk factor i also  speculated that  maybe all for one's real plan was not to  have shigaraki succeed him  but rather to take over shigaraki's body  so that he could have a new young body  instead of his own  old and injured one we know that back  when he was injured by all might  all for one anujiko had not yet  discovered the super regeneration quirk  and because of that all for one could  never use that quirk to recover his body  but now that shigaraki does possess this  quirk  if all for one really was to take over  shigaraki's body  he would have everything that he needs  to once again  become the greatest power in all of  japan  even though i had mentioned this theory  at the time shigeru seemed determined to  carve out his own path  and he pushed all for one's  consciousness to 